  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Tam giác <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> (do <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành) nên <div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><